{"synopsis":"Dari studio yang mengerjakan <The S-Classes That I Raised>\n\nBatas Pertumbuhan, Rank 1.\n\nVerdan, seorang peneliti yang tidak memiliki bakat sebagai penyihir, bercita-cita untuk mencapai puncak Magic Tower melalui kecerdasannya yang jenius.\n\nNamun, setelah menarik perhatian Master Tower, ia dijadikan salah satu subjek eksperimen tersebut.\n\nSetelah bertahun-tahun menanggung penghinaan dan keputusasaan selama tujuh tahun, Verdan akhirnya mulai bergerak, bertekad untuk menembus batas dirinya sendiri menggunakan teori-teori yang ia kembangkan dan sumber kekuatan Magic Tower!","alternative_title":"한계 찢는 천재마법사","author":"Plankton","artist":"Kim Hyunjun","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"f5ab4b5f-2d9f-4842-b200-757e6bc71501","number":"62","chapter":"62","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d8efab60-cada-4d99-be3a-e813f75ba72f/chapter_ch_1/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d8efab60-cada-4d99-be3a-e813f75ba72f/chapter_ch_2/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d8efab60-cada-4d99-be3a-e813f75ba72f/chapter_ch_3/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d8efab60-cada-4d99-be3a-e813f75ba72f/chapter_ch_4/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d8efab60-cada-4d99-be3a-e813f75ba72f/chapter_ch_5/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d8efab60-cada-4d99-be3a-e813f75ba72f/chapter_ch_6/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d8efab60-cada-4d99-be3a-e813f75ba72f/chapter_ch_7/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d8efab60-cada-4d99-be3a-e813f75ba72f/chapter_ch_8/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d8efab60-cada-4d99-be3a-e813f75ba72f/chapter_ch_9/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d8efab60-cada-4d99-be3a-e813f75ba72f/chapter_ch_10/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d8efab60-cada-4d99-be3a-e813f75ba72f/chapter_ch_11/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d8efab60-cada-4d99-be3a-e813f75ba72f/chapter_ch_12/12.we